OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for former
OL,4,AEngland striker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque is set to be installed in
OL,7,FHalifax in honour of former England
OL,8,Fstriker Frank Worthington.
OL,10,FWorthington, who won eight England caps
OL,11,Fand scored twice for the national team,
OL,12,Fbegan his career at Huddersfield Town
OL,13,Fbefore playing for Leicester City,
OL,14,FBolton, Birmingham City, Southampton
OL,15,Fand Leeds United in a career spanning
OL,16,F25 years.
OL,18,FAn initial fundraising target to
OL,19,Fpurchase the plaque was hit within days
OL,20,Fof the campaign being launched by
OL,21,FHalifax Civic Trust.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
