OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for former
OL,4,AEngland striker
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Peters, volunteer and committee
OL,7,Fmember for the trust, said the plaque
OL,8,Fwould provide the community with "a way
OL,9,Fto remember" Worthington - who is
OL,10,Fbelieved to be Halifax's only ever
OL,11,Fcapped England player.
